<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53224" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπρος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ</span> by nature], ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>boar</i>, esp. <i>wild boar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.725
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>La.</u>
				196e
			</span></i>, etc.; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦς κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.783
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.21
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				202
			</span></i> (ubi v. Sch.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἧπαρ κάπρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					318.5
				</span></i>
			: in fem. sense, <i>sow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχευομένους τοὺς κάπρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anaxandr.
					47
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a
				<i>sea-fish, Capros aper</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philem.
				79.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				505a13
			</span></i>; a species found in the Achelous, ib.<i><span class="en">
				535b18
			</span></i>. (Cogn. with Lat. <i>caper</i>, ONorse <i>hafr</i>
			'he-goat', but not with Lat. <i>aper.</i>)</div>
